<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia November inflation rises 0.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Indonesia November inflation rises 0.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's month-on-month inflation in November was 0.57 percent against 0.41 percent in October, the Finance Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The annual inflation rate in November was 6.71 percent, it said.</p>
<p>			   Nov	 Oct	Nov 95</p>
<p>    Month/month    +0.57     +0.41	 +0.42</p>
<p>    Year/year	+6.71     +6.56	 +8.37</p>
<p>CPI sectors (month/month)</p>
<p>    Food	     +1.67     -0.04</p>
<p>    Housing	  +0.03     +0.52</p>
<p>    Textiles	 +0.10     +0.19</p>
<p>    Services	 +0.04     +0.98</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
